An implementation of BASIC

Made for hackClub terra 26/27

### How to use:

As of right now only the lexer and parts of the interpreter are tied into the main function.
Feel free to try it out though and try to break it a little.
Starting the app from a terminal will prompt you to enter a line of text.
This text is what the interpreter would run normally since BASIC works line by line.

Different text combinations will result in different tokens being generated:

GOTO => Keyword
mygoto => Identifier
20 => Long
20.1 => Float
"Hi" => String

in case of a variable assignment such as

a = 2 + b * (x + y)

an implementation of the shunting yard algorithm is invoked to try and get the R-value into RPN

